# Mingla CODEOWNERS — codified by ORCH-0840 [Regression-test enforcement + append-only CI].
#
# Test files require operator review on every PR. This pairs with the
# tests-append-only.yml CI gate: the gate blocks deletions and unauthorized
# modifications; CODEOWNERS ensures every authorized modification has been
# seen and approved by Seth.
#
# Order matters in CODEOWNERS — later patterns override earlier ones, so
# put broader rules above narrower ones.

# Default catch-all: no global owner (avoid pulling Seth into every PR).

# Test files — operator review required.
**/*.test.*       @sethogieva
**/*.spec.*       @sethogieva
**/__tests__/**   @sethogieva

# The append-only gate itself — changes here change the regression-test
# discipline of the entire repo, so operator review is mandatory.
.github/scripts/test-append-only-check.js   @sethogieva
.github/workflows/tests-append-only.yml     @sethogieva
.github/CODEOWNERS                          @sethogieva
